\n<td>中等规模</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"5-代码详解\"><a href=\"#5-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 代码详解\"></a>5. 代码详解</h2><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">min_dates</span>(<span class=\"params\">n</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化前缀和数组</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    pref = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * (n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        pref[i] = pref[i - <span class=\"number\">1</span>] + i</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 动态规划求解</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    res = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * (n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n + <span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        res[i] = pref[i] // <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> i &gt; <span class=\"number\">1</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> pref[i] % <span class=\"number\">2</span> == <span class=\"number\">1</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            res[i] += pref[i - <span class=\"number\">1</span>] // <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> res[n]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n^2)，因为我们需要遍历所有可能的相遇组合。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(n)，用于存储前缀和数组。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>: 与朴素方法相比，这种方法减少了计算量，提高了效率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"7-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#7-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 输入输出示例\"></a>7. 输入输出示例</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>: <code>n=4</code>，表示有4个人，他们的天数分别为：1, 30, 365, 365。</li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>: <code>1</code>，表示最少需要1次相遇。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P12843","path":"api/tags/P12843.json"}]}